            "heading": "",
            "text": "A group discussion round tests how you listen, structure your point, add value and handle disagreement, so preparation should focus on short clear contributions backed by one fact or example rather than on speaking the most."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Quality of contribution counts more than volume."
          },
